{"id":"stuttgart","name":"斯图加特","en":"Stuttgart","country":"Germany","lat":48.7775,"lng":9.18,"dek":"葡萄园与车间之间的内卡河谷首府","history":"斯图加特的名字据信来自古高地德语的“Stutengarten”，意为“母马园”。大约950年，神圣罗马皇帝奥托一世的儿子、施瓦本公爵鲁道夫在这里建立养马场，为父亲繁育战马。此后数百年间，聚落逐渐成为符腾堡伯爵的驻地。黑马跃立的市徽至今仍被保时捷用作标志，指向这段与马有关的早期记忆。","culture":"斯图加特国家剧院与斯图加特国立美术馆构成城市文化生活的骨架。国家剧院涵盖歌剧院、话剧团和芭蕾舞团，约翰·克兰科曾在此为斯图加特芭蕾舞团建立国际声誉。英国指挥家罗杰·诺林顿执掌斯图加特广播交响乐团期间，乐团在歌舞大厅定期演出。","pull":"一座从母马花园里长出来的工业都会","sights":[{"name":"宫殿广场","orig":"Schlossplatz","intro":"斯图加特最大的广场，位于市中心，正对新王宫。这里原为王宫前的阅兵场，如今是草坪、花坛、双喷泉与音乐亭构成的公共绿地。夏季常有本地人、学生与游客在此停留。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b3/StuttgartSchlossPlatz.JPG/960px-StuttgartSchlossPlatz.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":720},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Schlossplatz_(Stuttgart)"},{"name":"新王宫","orig":"Neues Schloss","intro":"符腾堡公爵卡尔·欧根在18世纪发起建造，1746年动工，直到1807年才完成，期间历经四位公爵、多位建筑师与持续的费用争议。部分参照凡尔赛宫风格。二战后重建为巴登-符腾堡州政府机构使用。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/46/Neues_Schloss_Schlossplatzspringbrunnen_Jubil%C3%A4umss%C3%A4ule_Schlossplatz_Stuttgart_2015_02.jpg/960px-Neues_Schloss_Schlossplatzspringbrunnen_Jubil%C3%A4umss%C3%A4ule_Schlossplatz_Stuttgart_2015_02.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":550},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%96%B0%E7%8E%8B%E5%AE%AB_(%E6%96%AF%E5%9B%BE%E5%8A%A0%E7%89%B9)"},{"name":"老王宫","orig":"Altes Schloss","intro":"10世纪末初建，随斯图加特从聚落成长为符腾堡首府而扩展。16世纪形成文艺复兴式宫殿与带回廊内院的面貌。18世纪环绕宫殿的护城河被填平，形成今天的席勒广场。现在设符腾堡州立博物馆。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b3/Altes_Schloss_S_-_vm01.jpg/960px-Altes_Schloss_S_-_vm01.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":643},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%80%81%E7%8E%8B%E5%AE%AB_(%E6%96%AF%E5%9B%BE%E5%8A%A0%E7%89%B9)"},{"name":"国王大厦","orig":"Königsbau","intro":"1856至1860年奉国王威廉一世之命建成，与对面的新王宫相对。其朝宫殿广场的外立面有34根立柱，长135米。20世纪下半叶一度成为斯图加特证券交易所所在地，其后部延伸为国王大厦商场。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b9/K%C3%B6nigsbau.JPG/960px-K%C3%B6nigsbau.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":419},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%9B%BD%E7%8E%8B%E5%A4%A7%E5%8E%A6"},{"name":"斯图加特电视塔","orig":"Stuttgarter Fernsehturm","intro":"1950年代建成，是世界上第一座混凝土结构电视塔。它位于城市高处，作为观景点可以俯瞰内卡河谷、盆地状的城市核心与周围森林和葡萄园。}","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4c/Stuttgarter_Fernsehturm6.jpg/960px-Stuttgarter_Fernsehturm6.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":2170},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fernsehturm_Stuttgart"}],"foods":[{"name":"德国饺子","orig":"Maultaschen","intro":"施瓦本地区的填馅面食，外层面皮通常包裹肉末、菠菜、面包屑与洋葱。可煎可煮，切成片后在肉汤中煮，或配洋葱与蛋煎食。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/33/Maultaschensuppe.jpg/960px-Maultaschensuppe.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":960},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Maultasche"},{"name":"鸡蛋疙瘩面","orig":"Spätzle","intro":"施瓦本传统面食，用面粉、鸡蛋、水和盐制成。新鲜面团压下沸水成形后捞出，常作烤肉配菜，也可与奶酪焗烤。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/28/Sp%C3%A4tzle-02.jpg/960px-Sp%C3%A4tzle-02.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":646},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sp%C3%A4tzle"},{"name":"洋葱烤肉","orig":"Zwiebelrostbraten","intro":"巴登-符腾堡地区常见主菜，以薄片牛肉煎制，顶部堆满炒洋葱，常配鸡蛋疙瘩面与肉汁。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d8/Zwiebelrostbraten_in_Wien_1.JPG/960px-Zwiebelrostbraten_in_Wien_1.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":650},"src":null},{"name":"盖斯堡行军菜","orig":"Gaisburger Marsch","intro":"源自斯图加特东部盖斯堡地区的炖菜，以牛肉汤、牛肉块、土豆、鸡蛋疙瘩面与洋葱构成。洋葱通常煎至深色后撒在汤上提味。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c8/Gaisburger_Marsch.jpg/960px-Gaisburger_Marsch.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":911},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gaisburger_Marsch"}],"hero":[{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e1/Neues_Schloss_Schlossplatzspringbrunnen_Schlossplatz_Stuttgart_2015_01.jpg/1280px-Neues_Schloss_Schlossplatzspringbrunnen_Schlossplatz_Stuttgart_2015_01.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":1280,"h":646},{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/15/Marquardtbau_2013_blue.jpg/1280px-Marquardtbau_2013_blue.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":1280,"h":837}],"outline":{"type":"Polygon","coordinates":[[[9.0386007,48.741318],[9.0516284,48.7405159],[9.0547898,48.7381375],[9.0540227,48.7374293],[9.0565347,48.733123],[9.0666221,48.7341538],[9.067602,48.7323617],[9.0672598,48.7305667],[9.0635292,48.7289929],[9.062808,48.7273789],[9.0712601,48.7252753],[9.0869266,48.715235],[9.1003348,48.7116724],[9.118793,48.7082631],[9.1396992,48.7094492],[9.1695052,48.7053724],[9.1938267,48.6947122],[9.2015829,48.6926511],[9.2224494,48.692201],[9.2449713,48.6945542],[9.2438641,48.6977118],[9.2394043,48.6970745],[9.2382478,48.7040496],[9.2387331,48.7063699],[9.2410846,48.7092527],[9.2397677,48.7115074],[9.2344252,48.711433],[9.2302489,48.7097116],[9.2165598,48.723784],[9.2114766,48.7265412],[9.2125924,48.7264028],[9.2127467,48.7289381],[9.2143324,48.7313752],[9.219812,48.7325371],[9.2225131,48.7314421],[9.226112,48.7314662],[9.2259104,48.7350513],[9.231934,48.7354729],[9.2332324,48.7380245],[9.2374924,48.7363192],[9.2392564,48.7371159],[9.2427059,48.741642],[9.2428854,48.7432168],[9.2444158,48.744068],[9.2512476,48.7401356],[9.2528639,48.740272],[9.2525787,48.7419443],[9.2555775,48.7425368],[9.2565445,48.7414697],[9.2578746,48.7427699],[9.2615849,48.7434063],[9.2590536,48.7454479],